<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intevac Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intevac Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Hambrecht &amp; Quist analyst Todd Bakar said he downgraded Intevac Inc to a hold from a buy.</p>
<p>--&quot;Although the company's backlog increased to $77.9 million (in the second quarter), we believe the majority of actual shipments will likely be realized in Q4-97 and Q1-98,&quot; Baker said in a research report.</p>
<p>--&quot;Hence, we are expecting a dramatic decline in revenues and earnings in Q3-97. In fact, we are now forecasting a loss of $0.02 per share for Q3, but a sharp rebound to $0.35 per share in Q4.&quot;</p>
</text>
